{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56356","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 良哉二章（一章十句，一章十二句）（良哉，协帝赉也。） 二 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 良哉二章（一章十句，一章十二句）（良哉，协帝赉也。） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜虎分符，朱藩戒路。\n棠郊去思，潼江来暮。\n恂恂德心，汪汪轨度。\n宽不容姧，直上不抵忤。\n煌煌发辉，绰绰垂裕。\n翊彼天聪，克昌景祚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}